translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookReviewButton	Review
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogTitle	Admin sign-in can't refresh the webhook
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogDescription	Devin registers a webhook on {{site}} with the admin sign-in and renews it regularly. The last renewals failed, so Jira updates (new comments, assignments, status changes) may stop reaching Devin:
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogReconnect	Reconnect the admin sign-in.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogReconnectHint	Sign in again as a Jira admin; Devin registers the webhook anew. Service-account credentials, project mappings and existing webhooks are kept. This fixes a revoked, expired or narrowed authorization.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogRefresh	Or refresh the webhook.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogRefreshHint	Retries the renewal with the current sign-in, without leaving Devin. Enough for a temporary Jira outage; if Jira keeps denying it, reconnect.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogWhyAdmin	Even with a service account added, only the admin sign-in can renew webhooks: Jira ties them to the account that registered them.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookError.auth	Jira denied the request: the admin account that connected Jira may have lost access, or its permissions or scopes changed.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookError.serviceAccountAuth	Jira denied the request. Webhooks are renewed by the admin sign-in, not the service account, so that admin account needs webhook (manage:jira-webhook) access.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookError.invalidConnection	Jira no longer finds the connected site or its webhook; the connection may have been removed on the Jira side.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookError.network	Devin couldn't reach Jira to renew the webhook. This is usually temporary; it will retry automatically.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookError.unknown	Renewing the webhook failed for an unexpected reason. Devin keeps retrying; if it persists, reconnect.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.attentionWebhookRetry	webhook not refreshing, refresh it or reconnect the admin sign-in
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogRefreshFirst	Refresh the webhook.
translation.jira.agentLink.settings.webhookDialogReconnectLater	If it keeps failing, reconnect the admin sign-in.
translation.jira.agentLink.tryAgain	Try again
translation.jira.agentLink.tryIt	Try it — assign a Jira work item to <agent>Devin</agent> and watch the session start.
translation.jira.agentLink.accountUnavailable	{{kind}} · unavailable for this site
translation.jira.agentLink.unknownSite	Unknown site
