translation.knowledge.title	Knowledge
translation.knowledge.movedToSkills	Knowledge has moved to skills
translation.knowledge.movedToSkillsDescription	Skills are the new home for the knowledge Devin uses in your sessions. View and manage your skills in Customize.
translation.knowledge.viewSkills	View skills
translation.knowledge.backToLegacyList	Back to knowledge
translation.knowledge.deprecationTitle	Knowledge is being deprecated
translation.knowledge.deprecationDescription	Knowledge is moving to skills. Your notes will be converted automatically into skills in a knowledge plugin, with their content unchanged. Devin will use them in sessions the same way it uses your notes today, and they stay stored in Devin, not in your repositories. Nothing is lost and no action is needed.
translation.knowledge.learnMore	Learn more
translation.knowledge.cleanup.title	Clean up your knowledge
translation.knowledge.cleanup.description	Run a session where Devin reviews the skills migrated from your knowledge, proposes which to remove, merge, or rename, and applies the changes you approve.
translation.knowledge.cleanup.run	Run cleanup session
translation.knowledge.cleanup.confirmTitle	Start a cleanup session?
translation.knowledge.cleanup.confirmDescription	This starts a real Devin session, which uses ACUs from your organization's balance like any other session. Devin will review your migrated skills and pause for your approval before deleting, merging, or renaming anything.
translation.knowledge.cleanup.confirm	Start session
translation.knowledge.cleanup.failed	Failed to start the cleanup session. Please try again.
